# Hyprland-specific window management overrides
# Most functionality is now in common files using variables
# This file is kept for potential Hyprland-specific customizations

# Currently empty - all Hyprland behavior is configured via variables in hyprland_key_chords.wks
# Common window management, workspace navigation, and application hooks are handled by:
# - common/window-management.wks (uses CMD_* variables)
# - common/applications.wks (uses WS_* variables for workspace hooks)
# - common/development.wks (uses WS_EMACS)
# - common/utilities.wks (uses WS_FEEDS)
# - common/screenshots.wks (uses CMD_GET_WINDOW_GEOMETRY)
